<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Russell Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Russell Corp cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Russell Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Russell Corp closed Tuesday at 32.</p>
</text>
